en-names></name><name><surname>Elbert</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Rockstroh</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The consumption of khat and other drugs in Somali combatants: a cross-sectional study</article-title><source>PLoS Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>e341</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18076280</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040341</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Global Youth Tobacco Survey (GYTS)</collab></person-group><article-title>Somalia &#x02013; Somaliland</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/Tobacco/global/GYTS/factsheets/emro/2004/somalia_factsheet.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kyrlesi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Soteriades</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name><name><surname>Warren</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name><name><surname>Kremastinou</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Papastergiou</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>NR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hadjichristodoulou</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tobacco use among students aged 13&#x02013;15 years in Greece: the GYTS project</article-title><source>BMC Public Health</source><year>2007</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>3</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17207291</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2458-7-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stojiljkovic</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Haralanova</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nikogosi